  /* 冯专属技能芯片：金色点缀流光镶边 + 炼金深紫底色 (Alchemy Gilded) */
  .skill-slot-chip.theme-purple:before {
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #f59e0b 0%, #d9b45c 40%, #c084fc 100%);
